# Characteristics = Fields (glossary)

User-facing product language is **Fields** (uk: **Поля**). Code still uses legacy `Characteristic*` names.

## Mapping

| Layer | Name |
|-------|------|
| UI / i18n values | Field / Поле |
| Code (`features/characteristics`, pages) | `Characteristic*` |
| Product form types / aliases | `VariantCustomField*` |
| API | `/workspace/variant-custom-fields` |

## Why

The domain started as “characteristics” in the client. Backend and product create payloads already use **variant custom fields**. UI was renamed to Fields without a full code rename to avoid a large churn PR.

## Rules for new work

- Visible copy: never say “characteristic” / “характеристика” — use Field / Поле.
- i18n keys may stay under `characteristics.*` for now; only **values** must say Field/Поле.
- Prefer existing `VariantCustomField` aliases when touching product-form code.
- Do not mass-rename folders/symbols unless explicitly requested; if renaming, target `variant-custom-fields` / `VariantCustomField`.
